      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The manuscript does not discuss specific exclusion criteria related to whether outcomes were measured versus reported, making this conditional element not applicable."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "All included trials assessed a COVID-19 vaccine compared with placebo (n = 32) or a control vaccine not immunogenic towards COVID-19 (n = 3) [37, 45]. The included vaccines were based on mRNA [34, 41, 42, 66]; viral vectors [37, 39, 43, 45, 47, 50, 52, 67]; protein-subunit [38, 53]; or inactivated virus [47-49, 51] (Table 5).",
      "reason": "The review groups studies by vaccine type (mRNA, viral vectors, protein-subunit, inactivated virus) and control type, which are linked to the synthesis results presented in the text and tables."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "There are no notable restrictions on study eligibility that require a specific rationale; the criteria are broad (e.g., 'irrespective of...')."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
}

